{
  "id": "morning-routine",
  "title": "起床與出門",
  "titleEn": "Morning Routine",
  "category": "家庭生活",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/morning-routine.webp",
    "alt": "在陽光明媚的溫馨家中，小男孩 Leo 開心地起床刷牙並吃早餐，媽媽在玄關微笑提醒他穿上鞋子，準備出門上學。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "text": "morning",
          "wordIds": [
            "morning"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " sun shines brightly into the room."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "早晨的陽光燦爛地照進房間。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/morning-routine/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "c65823c99a52e3791dcb3c80daf9c1547a306de8cf442a49f4c6f761ff4843f1",
        "sha256": "44fd530d3b0cbdaf9978b074c087896566fac62f2f1edbd1becc1437dc459686"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom comes in with a warm smile and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Good morning!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "good-morning"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽帶著溫暖的微笑走進來，說：「早安！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/morning-routine/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "53e69a3295478dbf65731de3075a45ed1f832a4d74effe455933f738e1e69f7b",
        "sha256": "8720c0df1e590080b3a9dbe63594193778064fed1999026ced71e744fc347f46"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She gently taps Leo and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's time to get up.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "its-time-to-get-up"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "她輕輕拍拍 Leo 說：「該起床了。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/morning-routine/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "82303bf520878c8a9073f648a6ea68335edd1ab902329b116cbd6d20460b9fec",
        "sha256": "8c23561be50fc9f304d4a9d7520db04181df5066f315c868905162a83cc892cd"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo "
        },
        {
          "text": "wakes",
          "wordIds": [
            "wake"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " up happily and brushes his "
        },
        {
          "text": "teeth",
          "wordIds": [
            "teeth"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 開心地醒來，並去刷牙。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/morning-routine/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "392b0e13dd45499f5a0a290c8f94aee67a35e4e1d72ba8620a7656080397d6e6",
        "sha256": "44c3fdeeec45d49e3702e2095eba8258ddad0e8052870080812c91aaf8887f34"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Next, he sits down at the table to eat "
        },
        {
          "text": "breakfast",
          "wordIds": [
            "breakfast"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "接著，他坐在餐桌旁吃早餐。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/morning-routine/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "946aaa4db43e0e4c7a37792c7e35d825b0b1e41667af3c1de741c4a20e77b755",
        "sha256": "d973b370a776cc06529fcdd13ed2e6226267bac8d248dba0b9c44496550536fe"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom points to the hallway and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Put on your ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-on-your-shoes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shoes",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-on-your-shoes"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "shoes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-on-your-shoes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽指著玄關說：「穿上你的鞋子。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/morning-routine/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "7c59ed2da0649d175e38ce3101351a3ff50f89a3332d3c1c992ee5d69a5f88cb",
        "sha256": "5a59df2b924c27b4f4d7b1e59c6d08e920ff8a8efd681fac8a277275b498100b"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo opens the front "
        },
        {
          "text": "door",
          "wordIds": [
            "door"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to go to school and calls, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "See you later!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "see-you-later"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 打開大門準備去上學，並大聲說：「待會見！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/morning-routine/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "180b7519a55205a32bf1c8d170e817b84794bdb96d2aea85816f63926003244a",
        "sha256": "2ca1f6134fbab258094b8554a8cba18cde89a35c865e64f40f34c60436688748"
      }
    }
  ],
